# App Designer structure

## Model

- Core logic in regular MATLAB files
- GUI calls core through DataModule or manager class
- ULTRASAT planner GUI: `02_matlab_ultrasat_planner_structure.mdc` (this folder)

## App Designer responsibilities

- Display data
- Collect user input
- Trigger actions

## Callback rules

- Short callbacks: read UI values, call core logic, update UI
- No heavy computation in callbacks

## State

- UI holds view state only
- Core state belongs to managers or planners

## What not to do

- No algorithms in callbacks
- No file I/O in UI unless UI-specific
- No backend communication from UI directly

## Output expectations

- Keep GUI thin
- Push logic into helpers or managers
